          "Mean $\\bar{x} = \\frac{3+6+8+1+3}{5} = \\frac{21}{5} = 4.2$.",
          "Deviations $(x_i - \\bar{x})^2$: $(3-4.2)^2=1.44$, $(6-4.2)^2=3.24$, $(8-4.2)^2=14.44$, $(1-4.2)^2=10.24$, $(3-4.2)^2=1.44$.",
          "$\\sum (x_i - \\bar{x})^2 = 1.44 + 3.24 + 14.44 + 10.24 + 1.44 = 30.8$.",
          "Population Variance $\\sigma^2 = \\frac{30.8}{5} = 6.16$ (Sample variance $s^2 = \\frac{30.8}{4} = 7.7$)."
        ],
        "finalAnswer": "\\sigma^2 = 6.16",
