      "topic": "Geometric Mean & Growth Rate",
      "questionText": "The rate of increase in population of a country during the last three decades is 5 percent, 8 percent, and 12 percent. Find the average rate of growth during the last three decades.",
      "tables": [],
      "answer": {
        "status": "complete",
        "steps": [
          "When rates of growth over time are compounded, Geometric Mean is the appropriate average.",
          "Growth factors: $1+r_1 = 1.05$, $1+r_2 = 1.08$, $1+r_3 = 1.12$.",
          "Product = $1.05 \\times 1.08 \\times 1.12 = 1.27008$.",
          "Compound factor $G = (1.27008)^{1/3} \\approx 1.0829$.",
          "Average rate of growth = $(1.0829 - 1) \\times 100 = 8.29\\%$."
        ],
        "finalAnswer": "8.29% per decade",
        "tableValuesUsed": "None",
        "sourceLink": "https://chatgpt.com/share/6af4959d-3f40-83ee-a7bc-7562286c5b1b"
