          "For distribution 2: $70 = \\frac{16}{\\bar{x}_2} \\times 100 \\implies \\bar{x}_2 = \\frac{1600}{70} = 22.86$."
        ],
        "finalAnswer": "\\bar{x}_1 = 35,\\ \\bar{x}_2 = 22.86",
